{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "20233",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.99,
      "end_seconds": 5.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "Hello? Doctor? I was told to come in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 10.31,
      "end_seconds": 14.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "Yes, have a seat. Tell me what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 15.48,
      "end_seconds": 21.47,
      "duration_seconds": 5.99,
      "text": "Well, I've been having pain going down the back of my left leg."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.15,
      "end_seconds": 25.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "So, how many days or weeks has it been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.42,
      "end_seconds": 31.93,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "It's been going on for about a year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.49,
      "end_seconds": 36.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "Mm-hmm. Would you say mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.45,
      "end_seconds": 39.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "It feels mild to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.8,
      "end_seconds": 46.79,
      "duration_seconds": 5.99,
      "text": "Alright, what about tingling in your left foot, have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.16,
      "end_seconds": 55.68,
      "duration_seconds": 7.52,
      "text": "Yeah. Four weeks, I'd say. As for tingling in my left foot, mild, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.46,
      "end_seconds": 74.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "Are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.67,
      "end_seconds": 80.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "Tiotropium inhaler. I take it once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.39,
      "end_seconds": 86.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.94,
      "text": "Sure. What conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.07,
      "end_seconds": 89.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "I've got high blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.13,
      "end_seconds": 91.51,
      "duration_seconds": 1.38,
      "text": "And besides that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.64,
      "end_seconds": 93.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.04,
      "text": "Yes, COPD."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.88,
      "end_seconds": 97.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.1,
      "end_seconds": 101.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.15,
      "end_seconds": 104.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Do you live by yourself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.89,
      "end_seconds": 110.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.31,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.23,
      "end_seconds": 112.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "Have you retired yet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.58,
      "end_seconds": 118.81,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "I retired from the post office two years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.19,
      "end_seconds": 125.5,
      "duration_seconds": 5.31,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.6,
      "end_seconds": 128.57,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "No allergies at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.55,
      "end_seconds": 144.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.38,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.84,
      "end_seconds": 146.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.05,
      "text": "No, never."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.9,
      "end_seconds": 157.53,
      "duration_seconds": 8.63,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any numbness between the legs, bowel problems or weakness in the foot?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.2,
      "end_seconds": 166.9,
      "duration_seconds": 7.7,
      "text": "No numbness between the legs, bowel problems or weakness in the foot, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.87,
      "end_seconds": 170.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "And what about fever or bladder problems?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.49,
      "end_seconds": 176.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "No fever or bladder problems, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.06,
      "end_seconds": 185.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "Alright, has your heart given you any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.17,
      "end_seconds": 187.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "Nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.41,
      "end_seconds": 193.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.76,
      "end_seconds": 197.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Bowels are regular, nothing odd."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 198.73,
      "end_seconds": 212.41,
      "duration_seconds": 13.68,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. Respiratory rate 15, temperature 36.7, BP is 113 over 70. Height 157 centimetres, oxygen saturation is 97 percent, weight 61 kilos, pulse 85."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.91,
      "end_seconds": 214.85,
      "duration_seconds": 0.94,
      "text": "Okay, noted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.91,
      "end_seconds": 218.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "Okay, time for me to examine you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.47,
      "end_seconds": 222.37,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9,
      "text": "So, nearly finished here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.99,
      "end_seconds": 246.58,
      "duration_seconds": 9.59,
      "text": "Straight leg raising on the left brings on the leg pain at about forty degrees, and the power and reflexes are normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 263.63,
      "end_seconds": 264.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "Fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 269.31,
      "end_seconds": 286.44,
      "duration_seconds": 17.13,
      "text": "You can relax now. So, based on the history and the examination, my working impression is sciatica from a lumbar disc irritation. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 287.83,
      "end_seconds": 290.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Will it clear up?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.14,
      "end_seconds": 305.66,
      "duration_seconds": 13.52,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's sciatica from a lumbar disc irritation, and we'll know more once the blood tests is back. We should do blood tests for back pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 306.34,
      "end_seconds": 308.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "Right, you know, understood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 314.2,
      "end_seconds": 319.83,
      "duration_seconds": 5.63,
      "text": "I think an MRI of the lower back makes sense here, for sciatica."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 320.38,
      "end_seconds": 321.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.38,
      "text": "Does it hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 322.44,
      "end_seconds": 350.13,
      "duration_seconds": 27.69,
      "text": "What I'm giving you is naproxen, 500 milligrams, twice a day with food, for one week. That's for back and leg pain. Stay active and keep walking, bed rest makes this slower to settle. Come back or go to emergency straight away if you get numbness between the legs or trouble passing urine. I'd like to see you again after the scan. That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 355.75,
      "end_seconds": 359.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 360.17,
      "end_seconds": 361.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.17,
      "text": "Look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}